  "goodToKnow": "Die Poesie is poetry, or poetic quality in general: die Poesie des Alltags. As a literary genre, German usually says die Lyrik, while Poesie sounds more emotional or old-fashioned. Das Poesiealbum is a childhood tradition: a little book that friends and teachers fill with short verses, drawings and wishes. Der Poet is a poet, poetisch means poetic, and der Poetry-Slam is a popular performance event. Stress: po-e-ZEE."
